    <main>
        <section class="page-header">
            <div class="container">
                <h1>Practitioner Directory</h1>
                <p>Connect with compassionate, experienced practitioners across India</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="content">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Find Support & Treatment</h2>
                <p>
                    Our directory includes psychiatrists, therapists, counselors, and support workers who are experienced with schizophrenia
                    and committed to compassionate, holistic care. Practitioners may specialize in:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Clinical support and medication management</li>
                    <li>Psychotherapy and counseling</li>
                    <li>Family therapy and support</li>
                    <li>Peer support and peer-led recovery</li>
                    <li>Holistic and complementary approaches</li>
                    <li>Occupational and vocational support</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>Add a Practitioner to Our Directory</h2>
                <p>
                    Know a practitioner who should be listed? We welcome nominations and self-registrations from:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Psychiatrists and mental health doctors</li>
                    <li>Psychologists and therapists</li>
                    <li>Counselors and social workers</li>
                    <li>Peer support specialists and lived experience facilitators</li>
                    <li>Holistic and alternative practitioners with experience supporting people with schizophrenia</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="cta-section">
                    <h3>Register as a Practitioner or Nominate Someone</h3>
                    <p>Fill out the form below or contact us directly if you'd like to be added to our directory.</p>
                    <a href="https://forms.gle/YOUR_FORM_ID" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">Practitioner Registration Form</a>
                    <p class="note">Replace the form link above with your actual Google Form URL</p>
                </div>

                <h2>Practitioner Database</h2>
                <p>Our directory is growing! Practitioners will be displayed by location and specialty.</p>
                <p class="note">Directory entries will appear here as practitioners register.</p>

                <div class="directory-placeholder">
                    <p>Check back soon for our growing list of registered practitioners across India.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

